cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research toolkit, please cite it as follows."
title: "BPKH Governance Contagion Research Toolkit"
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: 2026-09-24
type: software
abstract: >-
  Research toolkit supporting the study "Detecting Governance Contagion:
  AI-Based Risk Intelligence for BPKH Hajj Fund Management." The toolkit
  provides the research methodology, analytical scripts, derived datasets,
  governance-risk taxonomy, network and temporal analysis outputs, Early
  Warning System framework, governance intelligence architecture, and
  Progressive Web App interface. The analytical study uses a news-only corpus
  covering 1 January 2024 to 3 September 2026, consisting of 561 final
  analytical news documents from eight Indonesian news outlets. The framework
  applies guided semantic risk mapping, Governance Contagion Index (GCI),
  governance-risk network analysis, Network Contagion Index (NCI), temporal
  and lead-lag analysis, unsupervised anomaly detection, and an AI-assisted
  Early Warning System. The indicators are research and decision-support
  signals and do not represent official BPKH risk ratings, corruption
  probabilities, causal estimates, or determinations of misconduct.
authors:
